OL,3,GNEWSATown council opposes design for
OL,4,Alarge new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council has formally opposed
OL,7,Fdesigns for a large mural planned for a
OL,8,Fshopping precinct.
OL,10,FThe artwork, proposed for Bury Street
OL,11,Fin Abingdon, Oxfordshire, would depict
OL,12,Flocal landmarks including the River
OL,13,FThames and St Helen's Church in vibrant
OL,14,Fcolours.
OL,16,FAbingdon Town Council's Public Art
OL,17,FWorking Group said its concerns
OL,18,Fincluded "the generic nature of the
OL,19,Fdesigns, their bold visual impact and
OL,20,Fwhether they are appropriate for
OL,21,FAbingdon's character as a historic
OL,22,Fmarket town".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
