OL,3,GNEWSATown council opposes design for
OL,4,Alarge new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are now being asked for their
OL,7,Fviews on the design, colour, imagery,
OL,8,Fsize and location of the artwork ahead
OL,9,Fof a final decision by Vale of White
OL,10,FHorse District Council. The
OL,11,Fconsultation closes on 10 December.
